Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.50,0:03:06.00,OPCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\be3}弱小的棋子啊 舞动起来
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.88,0:03:07.80,OPCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\be3}Zugzwang Du-Ra-ta-ta
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.80,0:03:11.59,OPCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\be3}在我的掌心上
